The release of XCOM 2 has been announced – this new game project will be launched this fall, initially planned by Firaxis Games only for PC.

Here are some reasons to download the XCOM 2 torrent for free:
- the storyline will tell about the events of the future, however, not so distant - only twenty years later;
- the capture of Earth! The invaders weren't zombies or some kind of mutant animals, but merely an alien race, although "merely" a race was able to defeat humanity;
- a new government – ​​a new order, and those who disagree with the current state of affairs are simply destroyed;
- beautiful promises – what lies behind the construction of new cities and the promise of prosperity for all of humanity?
- XCOM is a small organization that decided to stand up to the invaders and tell them about the secrets of a “new and beautiful future” hidden by the aliens;
- in constant anticipation of a threat lurking from all sides, hiding on the outskirts, in the slums, but still trying to fight - this is the fate of the members of the XCOM organization;
- users will have to become thieves to some extent, since there is nowhere to get resources for the war with aliens except from their bases, which they will have to attack;
- remaining in the shadows, but fighting, constantly balancing on the edge - such is the fate of the members of the XCOM organization - and, in fact, the player;
- procedural level design, making the gameplay unique each time;
- several classes of fighters to choose from;
- personalization of squads;
- opponents are also modified, so you won’t be bored;
- new tactical possibilities.

What they say about the new project:
Christoph Hartmann, 2K's CEO: Firaxis proved their skills with the first game, XCOM: Enemy Unknown, which won the Game of the Year award, and this second project is poised to revitalize the series with its epic storyline and the lofty goals it presents to players.
Jake Solomon, Creative Director at Firaxis Games: We relied heavily on player feedback from the first game, and that played a big role in creating a compelling strategy title that includes modding support, procedural levels, and, of course, new enemy types and soldier classes.

In conclusion:
A new plot twist, new enemies, and, of course, new technological capabilities — there's only one thing left to do: protect your beloved planet, remembering that the future of its inhabitants rests in your hands. Download XCOM 2 via torrent from us and research alien technology, develop your base, and plan your attack on the aliens, aided by control over your soldiers' movements.

